{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"coffeescript","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"CoffeeScript","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for CoffeeScript (.coffee .cson).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"coffeescript","name":"CoffeeScript","extensions":[".coffee",".cson"],"grammar":"grammars/coffeescript.json","lineComment":"#","blockComment":["###","###"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"CoffeeScript","path":"snippets/coffeescript.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/coffeescript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"###\",\n      \"end\": \"###\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"`(?:[^`\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*`\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"->|=>\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:instanceof|undefined|continue|debugger|extends|finally|delete|return|switch|typeof|unless|window|break|catch|class|false|super|throw|until|while|else|isnt|loop|null|then|this|true|when|and|for|new|not|off|try|yes|by|do|if|in|is|no|of|on|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:undefined|false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/coffeescript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:name} = (${2:args}) ->\",\n      \"\\t$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name}\",\n      \"\\tconstructor: (${2:args}) ->\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"For in\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"for\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for ${1:item} in ${2:items}\",\n      \"\\t$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"for in\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# CoffeeScript\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for CoffeeScript.\n\n## Files\n\n`.coffee`, `.cson`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `fn` | A function |\n| `class` | A class |\n| `for` | for in |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}